{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回ロングヘアーのBlogを書いたんですけど‥‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嘘ですっていうのを書き忘れてました‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書こうと思ったのにてっきり忘れてて‥皆さんからのコメント見て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわぁぁぁぁぁぁぁおっ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってめっちゃ焦りました‥ごめんちゃい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとメンバーも色々びっくりさせちゃったらしく‥ごめんよ‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、モバメの手の写メ、どちらがマアヤでしょう！って問題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれどっちもまあやです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左がまあやで、右はまさかの乃木メンバーではなく、仲良しの武田舞彩です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはさすがに正解の人いませんでしたねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でふざけてツインテールした！（≧∇≦）ショートでこの髪型をするのは最初で最後だろうなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回好評だったのでこんかいもっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.5 たむけんさんへ\n久しぶり～元気ですか？\n待ってるよ～^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.11 なななさんへ\n暖かいお風呂に入ってホットミルク飲んでみるのはどうかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.15 ゆづゆづかずみん命名さんへ\nブログを書くのは2～3日かけて書いてるの\n気を付けてるの言葉が伝わるかな～って思いながら書いてる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.21あやかまるさんへ\n755だった～笑\nありがとう～^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.25 きのこぼーやさんへ\n一緒に頑張ろうね～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.30 フォードさんへ\n乾燥‥間違えちゃった‥感想‥(^^;;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.35 えりぽんさんへ\nいつもありがとう～ぽ～ん^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.45 八潮のひささんへ\nボロ～ン‼︎ (^○^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.60ライダーマンさんへ\n当たりますように～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.69ベイちゃんさんへ\nまあやのお姉ちゃんになって～^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.78大阪のとしbowさんへ\n逢えるのを楽しみに待ってる～\nありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.80あいさんへ\nHello～あいちゃん(^o^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.85かほたろすさんへ\nお互いテスト頑張ろうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.91 よしえさんへ\n暖房はなるべく使わないようにはしてるよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.95 しほさんへ\nお菓子はチュロス好き～\n呼びかたはどっちも好きだよ～^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.131 さとうみゆりさんへ\n握手会来てくれてありがとう^o^\nまた逢えるのを楽しみに待ってる～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.165キューピーさんへ\n大根～^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.181いしこさんへ\nありがとう～   なむなむ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.186 サファイア茄子さんへ\n悩むけど‥ワクワクする事は挑戦してみよう！って思う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.192 まー坊さんへ\nミッキーと同じなんだ～すご～い！\nhappybirthday～^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.197 さっちゃんさんへ\nこれっ！って決めてなくて、ドラックストアで色々試してるの‥お勧めとかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.216 はなまるさんへ\nマラソン完走凄い～^o^\n筋肉痛は大丈夫ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.225 ぷろんさんへ\nいつもありがとう～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.231 UMKＯさんへ\nHello～(^O^)   ルンルン～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.240 もんきーますくさんへ\nいつもありがとう～^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.244 あつきさんへ\nまあや族じゃなくて‥‥まあ家族だよね（≧∇≦）\nいつもありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.246 やまさんへ\nうん！待ってるよ～^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.246 はっつんさんへ\nえっ‥照    \\(//∇//)\\"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.252 三郷のともゆきさんへ\nいつもありがとう～！気を付けて来てね\n待ってる～^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.266 りぃさんへ\n久しぶり～！おかえり～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.275 ななめこっさんへ\nえーっ！！楽しみ～！待ってるね～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.286 北海道のまあやっちさんへ\nこれ！本当に悩み中なの‥\n読んでると全部口に出して返事をしちゃいそうになるぐらい楽しいから、全員に返事をしたくなる\nでも、勉強も頑張りたい‥\nだからノートに返事を書いて、それからブログを書いてるの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.290 紫蓮さんへ\n山口にも行ってみたい～^o^\nこちらこそありがとう～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も皆んなが健康で笑顔でありますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似てるってよくメンバーとスタッフさんから言われますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どう？にてるかなぁ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/15/3640200/0015.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}